|content1=
* March 5th - '''Team QUAZAR''' enter ''[[Counter-Strike: Global Offensive]]'' with the signing of [[KarmaN]], [[Keedje]], [[shirasu]], [[CyXaPb]], [[AMOURSKY]] and [[Flife]] as their coach. <ref name="1st roster">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-189053071_21611|title=Помните новость про QUAZAR.NSK?|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=Remember the news about QUAZAR.NSK?|date=2021-03-05|author='''Team QUAZAR'''}}</ref>
* July 1st - '''Team QUAZAR''' part ways with their roster. <ref name="1st disband">{{inside source|source=7il7}}</ref>
* August 6th - '''Team QUAZAR''' sign a new roster consisting of [[k1ssly]], [[shady]], [[Gladik]], [[Frothe]], [[spirit (Russian player)|spirit]] and [[44]] as their coach. <ref name="QUAZAR 2021">{{inside source|source=7il7}}</ref>
* December 7th - '''Team QUAZAR''' part ways with [[k1ssly]] and sign [[la3euka]]. <ref name="-k1ssly +la3euka">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-207070390_10|title=Вкатился обратно в режим и можно поделиться некоторыми новостями|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=Got back into the swing of things and can share some news|date=2021-12-07|author=[[k1ssly]]}}</ref>

|content2=
* January 2nd - '''Team QUAZAR''' replace [[Gladik]] with [[faqzor]]. <ref name="-Gladik +faqzor">{{inside source|source=7il7}}</ref>
* August 3rd - '''Team QUAZAR''' part ways with [[faqzor]] and sign [[xdENiSZERA]]. <ref name="-faqzor +xden">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-207338884_2002|title=Дорогие друзья, нашу команду по CS:GO по собственному желанию покидает Кирилл "faqzor" Свиридов|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=Dear friends, Kirill "faqzor" Sviridov is leaving our CS:GO team at his own request|date=2022-08-03|author='''Team QUAZAR'''}}</ref>
* October 16th - '''Team QUAZAR''' replace [[la3euka]] with [[fenvicious]]. <ref name="-la3euka +fenvicious">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-207338884_2351|title=На протяжении полугода самый актуальный вопрос, относящийся к TEAM QUAZAR это - "Играет ли Лазейка в составе или нет?"|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=For half a year the most pressing question related to TEAM QUAZAR is - "Is la3euka playing in the team or not?"|date=2022-10-16|author='''Team QUAZAR'''}}</ref>
* December 29th - '''Team QUAZAR''' part ways with their roster. <ref name="disband 2022">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-207338884_2968|title=Дорогие друзья. В конце 2022 года мы расстаёмся с составом по Dota 2 и первой пятеркой TEAM QUAZAR|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=Dear friends. At the end of 2022, we will part ways with the Dota 2 roster and the top five of TEAM QUAZAR.|date=2022-12-29|author='''Team QUAZAR'''}}</ref>

|content3=
* January 14th - '''Team QUAZAR''' promote [[D54]]'s roster consisting of [[HEADBANGER]], [[Gladik]], [[ka1do]], [[olymp1c]] and [[n1ckey]] to the main team. <ref name="QUAZAR 2023">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-207338884_2985|title=Представляем состав Team QUAZAR по CS:GO, на начало 2023 года!|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=Introducing the Team QUAZAR CS:GO roster for early 2023!|date=2023-01-14|author='''Team QUAZAR'''}}</ref>
* February 1st - '''Team QUAZAR''' part ways with [[Gladik]] and [[n1ckey]] and promote [[ax1nty]] from [[D54]] roster. <ref name="-2 +ax1nty">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-207338884_3077|title=Считаем, что тренерский эксперимент Дима Дзуцев удался|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=We believe that Dima Dzutsev's coaching experiment was a success|date=2023-02-01|author='''Team QUAZAR'''}}</ref>
* April 10th - '''Team QUAZAR''' part ways with [[ax1nty]] and sign [[L4F]] and [[Electro]]. <ref name="-ax1nty +2">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-207338884_3258|title=Те, кто следят за трансляциями, наверное, заметили новые ники в последних играх|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=Those who follow the broadcasts probably noticed new nicknames in the latest games|date=2023-04-10|author='''Team QUAZAR'''}}</ref>
* May 12th - [[44]] is acquired by [[VP.Prodigy]]. <ref name="44 to VPP">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-207338884_3309|title=Ну что, наконец мы можем сообщить вам, наверное, главную новость за последнее время, связанную с командой Team Quazar|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=Well, finally we can tell you, probably, the most important news of recent times, related to the Team QUAZAR|date=2023-05-12|author='''Team QUAZAR'''}}</ref>
* July 25th - '''Team QUAZAR''' part ways with [[ka1do]] and [[olymp1c]] and sign [[xnkka]] and [[dehier]]. <ref name="shuffle 2">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-207338884_3362|title=Лучше поздно чем никогда, правда ведь?|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=Better late than never, right?|date=2023-07-25|author='''Team QUAZAR'''}}</ref>
* October 18th - '''Team QUAZAR''' part ways with [[HEADBANGER]] and [[dehier]]. <ref name="-HEADBANGER -dehier">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-207338884_3490|title=Изменения в составе!|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=Roster changes!|date=2023-10-18|author='''Team QUAZAR'''}}</ref>
* October 26th - '''Team QUAZAR''' sign [[KarmaN]]. <ref name="+KarmaN">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-207338884_3502|title=Мы наконец-то готовы официально представить нашего четвертого игрока|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=We are finally ready to officially introduce our fourth player|date=2023-10-26|author='''Team QUAZAR'''}}</ref>
* November 24th - '''Team QUAZAR''' sign [[kirito]]. <ref name="+kirito">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-207338884_3582|title=С задержкой, но все же пора вам представить нашего пятого игрока|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=It's a bit late, but it's time to introduce you to our fifth player|date=2023-11-24|author='''Team QUAZAR'''}}</ref>
* December 12th - '''Team QUAZAR''' sign [[ARSENY]] as their new assistant coach. <ref name="+ARSENY">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-207338884_3620|title=Арсений "ARSENY" Сорокин - новый тренер TEAM QUAZAR|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=Arseniy "ARSENY" Sorokin - new coach of TEAM QUAZAR|date=2023-11-24|author='''Team QUAZAR'''}}</ref>

|content4=
* May 14th - '''Team QUAZAR''' replace [[kirito]] with [[Dis1]]. <ref name="-kirito +Dis1">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-207338884_3900|title=Печальные новости|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=Sad news|date=2024-10-26|author='''Team QUAZAR'''}}</ref>
* June 5th - '''Team QUAZAR''' part ways with their roster. <ref name="disband 2024">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/teamquazar?w=wall-207338884_4020|title=TEAM QUAZAR - дизбанд|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=TEAM QUAZAR - disband|date=2024-06-05|author='''Team QUAZAR'''}}</ref>
* July 24th - '''QUAZAR''' sign [[DOSKI]]'s roster consisting of [[Muk0s]], [[N4mb3r5]], [[tommy171]], [[gehji]], [[whisper]] and [[44]] as their coach. <ref name="QUAZAR 2024">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/teamquazar?w=wall-207338884_4156|title=Новый состав QUAZAR x 44|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=New roster of QUAZAR x 44|date=2024-07-24|author='''Team QUAZAR'''}}</ref>

|content5=
* January 19th - '''QUAZAR''' part ways with [[Muk0s]]. <ref name="-Muk0s">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-207338884_5116|title=Валерий "muk0s" Муковнин покидает QUAZAR|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=Valeriy "Muk0s" Mukovnin leaves QUAZAR|date=2025-01-19|author='''QUAZAR'''}}</ref>
* January 20th - '''QUAZAR''' sign [[fleer]]. <ref name="+fleer">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-207338884_5121|title=Алексей "fleer" Старлытов - новый игрок QUAZAR x 44|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=Aleksey "fleer" Starlytov - new player of QUAZAR x 44|date=2025-01-19|author='''QUAZAR'''}}</ref>
* February 6th - '''QUAZAR''' promote [[WebSun]] from the academy team. <ref name="+WebSun">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-207338884_5191|title=Труд и терпение приносят свои плоды!|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=Hard work and patience bear fruit!|date=2025-02-06|author='''QUAZAR'''}}</ref>
* February 8th - '''QUAZAR''' part ways with [[fleer]]. <ref name="-fleer">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-207338884_5215|title=Наш совсем недолгий путь с Алексеем заканчивается|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=Our very short journey with Aleksey is coming to an end|date=2025-02-08|author='''QUAZAR'''}}</ref>
* April 1st - '''QUAZAR''' part ways with [[WebSun]]. <ref name="-WebSun">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-207338884_5391|title=01.04 основной состав QUAZAR x 44 покинул Кирилл "WebSun" Аникьев|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=01.04 Kirill "WebSun" Anikiev left the main lineup of QUAZAR x 44|date=2025-04-09|author='''QUAZAR'''}}</ref>
* April 9th - '''QUAZAR''' acquire [[Dis1]] from [[PARTIZAN]]. <ref name="+Dis1">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-207338884_5393|title=Новый капитан основного состава QUAZAR x 44 — Артём "Dis1" Белокосов!|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=The new captain of the main team of QUAZAR x 44 is Artem "Dis1" Belokosov!|date=2025-04-09|author='''QUAZAR'''}}</ref>
* April 18th - [[tommy (Russian player)|tommy]] is acquired by [[AMKAL ESPORTS]]. <ref name="-tommy">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-207338884_5442|title=
Святослав "tommy" Целовальников — игрок AMKAL ESPORTS!|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=Svyatoslav "tommy" Tselovalnikov is a player of AMKAL ESPORTS!|date=2025-04-19|author='''QUAZAR'''}}</ref>
* May 27th - '''QUAZAR''' promote [[kaiori]] from the [[QUAZAR Academy|academy team]]. <ref name="+kaiori">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-207338884_5586|title=
Егор «kaiori» Торжков — в основном составе QUAZAR x 44!|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=Egor "kaiori" Torzhkov is in the main lineup of QUAZAR x 44!|date=2025-05-27|author='''QUAZAR'''}}</ref>
* September 1st - '''QUAZAR''' bench [[whisper]] and sign [[1zz]]. <ref name="+1zz, whisper bench">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-207338884_5945|title=После четырёх тяжелейших месяцев работы практически без отпуска мы уходим на трёхнедельный перерыв|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=After four hard months of work with virtually no vacation, we are going on a three-week break|date=2025-09-01|author='''QUAZAR'''}}</ref>
* September 11th - '''QUAZAR''' part ways with [[Dis1]]. <ref name="-Dis1">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-207338884_5944|title=
Наши пути с Артёмом Dis1 Белокосовым расходятся|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=Our paths with Artem Dis1 Belokosov diverge|date=2025-09-11|author='''QUAZAR'''}}</ref>
* October 13th - '''QUAZAR''' sign [[newt]]. <ref name="+newt">{{cite web|url=https://t.me/tquazar/484|title=Илья "newt" Воронов - новый игрок QUAZAR x 44!|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=Ilya "newt" Voronov is the new QUAZAR x 44 player!|date=2025-09-11|author='''QUAZAR'''}}</ref>
* October 15th - [[whisper]]'s contract expires and he leaves the team. <ref name="-whisper">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-207338884_6033|title=15 октября мы расстались с Гаделем Whisper Галимуллиным|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=On October 15th we parted ways with Gadel Whisper Galimullin|date=2025-10-31|author='''QUAZAR'''}}</ref>

|content6=
* January 11th - '''QUAZAR''' part ways with [[N4mb3r5]] and sign [[Ne1XXX]]. <ref name="-N4mb3r5">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-207338884_6067|title=Апдейт по составу|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=Update on composition|date=2026-01-11|author='''QUAZAR'''}}</ref><ref name="+Ne1XXX">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-207338884_6076|title=Продолжаем рассказывать про изменения в составе|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=We continue to talk about changes in the line-up|date=2026-01-11|author='''QUAZAR'''}}</ref>
* May 7th - '''QUAZAR''' bench [[1zz]] and sign [[Porya]]. <ref name="1zz to Porya">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-207338884_6276|title=Важные новости!|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=Important news!|date=2026-05-07|author='''QUAZAR'''}}</ref>
}}

