'''RUSTEC''' is a [[:Category:Russia|Russian]] esports organization.

==Timeline==
{{Tabs dynamic
|name1=2024
|name2=2025
|name3=2026
|This=3

|content1=
* July 18th - '''RUSTEC''' announce their Counter-Strike 2 roster consisting of [[Dimaoneshot]], [[karnez]], [[eLa1z]], [[tENZY]], [[fleer]] and [[Mersik]] as coach. <ref name="rustec">{{cite web|url=https://t.me/rustec_gaming/9|title=Всем привет, на связи RUSTEC! Просим любить и жаловать наш состав по CS2|trans_title=Hey everyone, this is RUSTEC! Please love and support our CS2 team.|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|date=2024-07-18|author='''RUSTEC'''}}</ref>
* September 4th - '''RUSTEC''' bench [[eLa1z]]. <ref name="bench eLa1z">{{cite web|url=https://t.me/rustec_gaming/138|title=Решение о переводе в запас Ильи «eLa1z» Галеева было принято по окончании ESEA ADVANCED S50|trans_title=The decision to transfer Ilya "eLa1z" Galeev to the reserve was made after the end of ESEA ADVANCED S50|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|date=2024-09-04|author='''RUSTEC'''}}</ref>
* Septembert 12th - '''RUSTEC''' part ways with [[Dimaoneshot]]. <ref name="-dimaoneshot">{{cite web|url=https://t.me/rustec_gaming/139|title=Пришло время сказать ОГРОМНОЕ СПАСИБО и попрощаться с нашим капитаном Дмитрием «Dimaoneshot» Бандурка!|trans_title=It's time to say a HUGE THANK YOU and farewell to our captain, Dmitry "Dimaoneshot" Bandurka!|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|date=2024-09-12|author='''RUSTEC'''}}</ref>
* September 26th - '''RUSTEC''' sign [[DayMake]] and [[Remill]]. <ref name="+daymake">{{cite web|url=https://t.me/rustec_gaming/142|title=А вот и наши новые игроки, добро пожаловать! Роман «DayMake» Малышев (AWP)|trans_title=Welcome to our new players! Roman "DayMake" Malyshev (AWP)|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|date=2024-09-26|author='''RUSTEC'''}}</ref><ref name="+remill">{{cite web|url=https://t.me/rustec_gaming/143|title=А вот и наши новые игроки, добро пожаловать! Андрей «Remill» Романов (Riffler/Lurker)|trans_title=Welcome to our new players! Andrey "Remill" Romanov (Riffler/Lurker)|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|date=2024-09-26|author='''RUSTEC'''}}</ref>
* October 21st - '''RUSTEC''' bench [[tENZY]] and [[fleer]] and part ways with [[Remill]], [[DayMake]] and [[Mersik]]. <ref name="bench tenzy">{{cite web|url=https://t.me/rustec_gaming/149|title=С сегодняшнего дня Никита "tENZY" переводится в запас нашей команды, и мы открыты к любым предложениям!|trans_title=Starting today, Nikita "tENZY" will be transferred to our team's reserve team, and we are open to any offers!|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|date=2024-10-21|author='''RUSTEC'''}}</ref><ref name="bench fleer">{{cite web|url=https://t.me/rustec_gaming/150|title=Алексей "Fleer" Старлытов так же переводится в запас нашей команды, открыты к любым предложениям|trans_title=Alexey "Fleer" Starlytov is also being transferred to our team's reserve team; we are open to any offers|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|date=2024-10-21|author='''RUSTEC'''}}</ref><ref name="-remill/daymake">{{cite web|url=https://t.me/rustec_gaming/147|title=Мы благодарим Remill и DayMake за уделенное нам время, самоотдачу процессу, но пришло время двигаться дальше|trans_title=We thank Remill and DayMake for their time and dedication to the process, but it's time to move on.|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|date=2024-10-21|author='''RUSTEC'''}}</ref><ref name="-mersik">{{cite web|url=https://t.me/rustec_gaming/151|title=К сожалению нашу команду покидает тренер Артём «Mersik» Галабурда|trans_title=Unfortunately, our coach Artem "Mersik" Galaburda is leaving our team|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|date=2024-10-21|author='''RUSTEC'''}}</ref>
* October 24th - '''RUSTEC''' sign [[eLa1z]], [[fiction]], [[xnkka]] and [[Rezkiyy]]. <ref name="+new squad">{{cite web|url=https://t.me/rustec_gaming/156|title=И так, наш состав на предстоящий сезон выглядит следующим образом|trans_title=So, our roster for the upcoming season looks like this:|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|date=2024-10-24|author='''RUSTEC'''}}</ref>
* November 26th - '''RUSTEC''' bench [[karnez]]. <ref name="-karnez">{{cite web|url=https://t.me/rustec_gaming/200|title=Наша организация выражает огромную благодарность Эрнесту "karnez" Казакову|trans_title=Our organization expresses its deep gratitude to Ernest "karnez" Kazakov|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|date=2024-11-26|author='''RUSTEC'''}}</ref>
* December 7th - '''RUSTEC''' sign [[reNIK]]. <ref name="+renik">{{cite web|url=https://t.me/rustec_gaming/203|title=Пришло время поприветствовать нашего нового игрока! Юрий «reNIK» Чаринцев (Riffler)|trans_title=It's time to welcome our newest player! Yuri "reNIK" Charintsev (Riffler)|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|date=2024-12-07|author='''RUSTEC'''}}</ref>
* December 23rd - '''RUSTEC''' part ways with [[fleer]] and [[karnez]]. <ref name="-fleer/karnez">{{cite web|url=https://t.me/rustec_gaming/225|title=Организация RUSTEC выражает благодарность Алексею «Fleer» Старлытову и Эрнесту «karnez» Казакову за совместно пройденный путь. Желаем удачи во всех новых начинаниях!|trans_title=RUSTEC expresses its gratitude to Alexey "Fleer" Starlytov and Ernest "karnez" Kazakov for the journey they have shared. We wish you success in all your new endeavors!|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|date=2024-12-23|author='''RUSTEC'''}}</ref>
