'''Rune Eaters Esports''' is a [[:Category:Kazakhstan|Kazakh]] professional esports organization founded in 2020. They also field rosters in ''[[:dota2:Main Page|Dota 2]]'' and ''[[:honorofkings:Main Page|Honor of Kings]]''.

