|content1=
* June 17th - '''SPARTA Esports''' sign the former [[FLuffy Gangsters]]' roster consisting of [[Djon8]], [[SoLb]], [[yuramyata]], [[1NVISIBLEE]], and [[k4nfuz]]. <ref name="sparta esports">{{cite web|url=https://t.me/spartaesports/10|title=Поднять щиты за Спарту и за её новый состав игроков|trans_title=Raise your shields for Sparta and its new roster of players|language={{flag|ru}} Russian|date=2025-06-17|author='''SPARTA Esports'''}}</ref>
* July 22nd - '''SPARTA Esports''' sign [[Nevar]] as coach. <ref name="+nevar">{{cite web|url=https://t.me/spartaesports/65|title=SPARTA Esports с гордостью приветствует нового тренера - Алексея «Nevar» Воронова|trans_title=SPARTA Esports proudly welcomes its new coach, Alexey "Nevar" Voronov|language={{flag|ru}} Russian|date=2025-07-22|author='''SPARTA Esports'''}}</ref>
* September 30th - '''SPARTA Esports''' part ways with [[Nevar]]. <ref name="-nevar">{{cite web|url=https://t.me/spartaesports/293|title=Sparta Esports прощается с Алексеем «Nevar» Вороновым|trans_title=Sparta Esports bids farewell to Alexey "Nevar" Voronov|language={{flag|ru}} Russian|date=2025-09-30|author='''SPARTA Esports'''}}</ref>

|content2=
